  "goodToKnow": "Die Ausschreitung, mostly plural Ausschreitungen, is a violent disturbance or riot: Es kam zu schweren Ausschreitungen. It's typical of news reports about football matches, demonstrations or the 1 May protests in Berlin-Kreuzberg. Synonyms: die Krawalle (riots), die Unruhen (unrest). Literally, it means stepping (schreiten) beyond the limits. Don't confuse it with die Ausschreibung (tender, job advertisement). Plural: die Ausschreitungen."
